 "source": "official manual PDF https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gFgAQgeXL.pdf: 34CH chart (read in full 2026-10-27), simple 6CH chart p.5. 34CH = two 17-channel groups: CH1-17 group A, CH18-34 group B (CH18 = group on/off; CH20 no function).",
 "notes": "Laser output must remain disabled pending actual warning-label/class, compliance and installation review. Never scan an audience or aim at eyes, reflective surfaces, aircraft or the sky. Haze or trees are not proof of safe beam termination. Engine laser_armed is a software interlock, not laser safety certification. 34CH: BOTH on/off channels (CH1 and CH18) must be 0 for the laser to be dark; the engine forces role-laser channels to 0 unless laser_armed. The manual has NO plain 'manual DMX on' value on CH1 in 34CH mode (1-99 auto, 100-199 sound, 200-254 saving, 255 pattern A off): which value gives DMX-controlled patterns must be found by a supervised test. (default_mode stays 6ch for compatibility; the rig entry for the real unit sets mode 34ch.)",
